355 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 244 0 R
/E (SST Makerspace is a student-led innovation hub operating under the School of Science and Technology \(SST\) at Pan-Atlantic University. Our primary purpose is to provide hands-on opportunities for students to learn, design, build, and innovate practical solutions through competitions, workshops, and collaborative projects. We are deeply committed to inspiring creativity and confidence in engineering and science students, bridging the gap between theory and practice through real-world design projects, and promoting collaboration across disciplines. Ultimately, we strive to build a culture of innovation that aligns with both academic rigor and industrial needs.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
356 0 obj
<<
