<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 245 0 R
/E (The SST Makerspace 3.0 delivers a transformative engineering experience that bridges the gap between classroom theory and real-world application, while also introducing participants to the journey of turning ideas into usable products. Students engage in the hands-on design and development of functional hardware systems, building strong competence in mechanics, electronics, embedded systems, and system integration, all within realistic constraints.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
373 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 245 0 R
/E (Beyond technical skills, participants develop professional and entrepreneurial capabilities through teamwork, leadership, communication, and problem-solving under pressure. With guidance from mentors, industry professionals, and business experts, especially within the Product Category, students learn how to refine designs, validate use cases, and think critically about feasibility, users, and value creation. The competition environment balances healthy rivalry with collaboration, ensuring learning, creativity, and innovation are rewarded alongside performance.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
