/E (To get this inverted walking thing to work reliably, we're using a clever mechanical setup we call the "double-sided inverse shaft connected to a central rotating shaft." The whole point of this is to keep things simple by using a single motor and avoiding the headache of trying to perfectly sync up multiple motors.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [0]
>>
