/Title (Extra Stability: If just placing the components doesn't give us the stability we need, we might have to add a secondary measure. A simple, passive "hanger" or tail system at the back of the robot can act as a counterbalance. Just remember, if we add a tail or any stabilizing element, it counts as a full, functional part of the robot and must be included in the final size and weight calculations for the competition rules.)
